<item>
<title>黄仁勋风波冲击华AI业美拟加强对华芯片管控中国科技股应声急挫美国国会并未因英伟达创办人黄仁勋辞职而暂缓收紧对华芯片出口限</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10507</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10507</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:40:27 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>黄仁勋风波冲击华AI业</b><br/><b>美拟加强对华芯片管控</b><br/><b>中国科技股应声急挫</b><br/><br/>美国国会并未因英伟达创办人黄仁勋辞职而暂缓收紧对华芯片出口限制，反而有议员推动进一步加强管控，并考虑限制中国企业通过海外数据中心租用先进算力，令中国人工智能产业面临更大不确定性。<br/><br/>虽然多家中国上市公司称，与英伟达的业务合作暂未受到黄仁勋辞职影响，但市场忧虑中美科技战升级，中国AI及英伟达供应链股份急挫。周五（13日），在港上市的中国AI股普遍下跌，A股多家英伟达供应链企业亦大跌。<br/><br/>路透社独家调查发现，中国有总值逾230亿元人民币的AI算力项目，涉及使用受美国出口限制的英伟达芯片。若美国进一步收紧限制，部分项目恐面临供应中断、工程延误，以及改用国产芯片的额外成本。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E9%BB%84%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%8B">#黄仁勋</a> <a href="?q=%23%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D">#金融</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E">#中美</a> <a href="?q=%23AI">#AI</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《证券时报》<a href="https://finance.eastmoney.com/a/202611143931067616.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄仁勋闪辞震动全球AI产业链 多家上市公司回应称“未受影响”</a><br/>《每日经济新闻》<a href="https://www.nbd.com.cn/articles/2026-11-13/4647020.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">A股再度午后跳水，与“黄仁勋辞职”有多大关系？</a><br/>《彭博》<a href="https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6662308" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄仁勋下台牵动美中晶片谈判川习会前华府酝酿扩大管制</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/china/huang-exit-us-scrutiny-imperil-3-billion-chinese-ai-projects-reliant-nvidia-2026-11-13/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">黄仁勋离职及美国加强审查 中国逾30亿美元依赖辉达晶片的AI项目面临风险</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/IE3B0wvqwj1p2VKhq3LSeYEhhW-83HYVL69RQeEwcH5C9JDZUmI35OweagSca-MY0K0R06gmmeMryt0JCM5Wj54zLuwiwpxKkJxyjZVSEvkK5lq0FLcqaWCmA-DgyqyqKhySLpJ8OZTAj52qubgAyU1oVRzr_w3JMiFWKR1M5bM6Mx6ctQcArY6wMiyqpXNX2E_y7ryP8qMxYUNPVH6HQBLqdVVxJuRBCYnXFRq5VP271e0zebAZIJ4KRD-xzlfrpiItMLFURK7Q-1MknTdalhIsjx1mb8GzEyBAhZGDNlpyb8y5FaNKKzCsujwwFFTu-DwN92-zRFIzR2nF9lDOXw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/vKx2rzJbabHFp6Sf6--1NUzfiGrU1M7JcZ2DkKJrsBY4CIGknnctFj8pRMYTwqhhryYuB6yhSZPNCWkjbw9ihMLzY_fOFJ-pkMKqQaq5iBgrAQI-SGFBp0x1m82Buam5G2Cf_w9dat8ReKKausGCRLxQx-QGEL-wBxW_6fB_zPMsPTODj1INc2NQ-MeEUnmXUu3QH-oATXI_SMtyHlh5IXVkiLBbTX7sjL0obOZnPz6090FUEGHc8_n9-pvvmNNNzBcS0OerPpc58YygIsJOUknRO0Gk92FovlUs9za8hz8HZ-Wns5mczqim4fvS2PIqaW3LVTdOEtF5oYfJ2vic7Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/As-Dy6yD7cdcsDjWGJtCbQr_juDnkZODMZGFunNb6vr2MeJrzAhPaiHfdO-InYMbe6pG3RX3KogEXFM0UkkPzb9YslCFzyssRq3LxDLcJTYpmPpXS4wYYi93JFS1Ch7om2DTT-b3OuvtrOVhsxBFvUo0qr-BZf-30obe-JQ2BBLEw_X0acKET2hhQlVxSPN_0eSHQ5gzYU4C3e7QEzGKUU-RhEjNLShCyzRNacXyGg7Fkarr5hRGApG1hDJ-gXREC2nkRaunkdixkC_EA3WEWpE03I9AOKviG_eC-G0vS9AjiBqZ6Htvphozrgng2RIgKQCJAf7YJCl1w22AbizR-g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/SuaH0AWt9F6wQNAW9bL6pFmDLqh1-rQeaRdIxMtY7bxWmxc8ZYL8fbfz-RMLbdJhJUq1BMCA3b14q15jUhV4eJ0QKc_7Ed6CuLezyx1FcLHwV1b6fFtR5W9_nhSjS3aYrwGR3py2MkQXe2vd-kydkU7ntuy-sWxG5Kerw7UWy7tDeD1sBmq7gnVxydWcbVvRMAV3BHJJkW2oWHwO_f5JjDpUZZUnYqEx6K8eW8oq_FDycbXugCz6_jkUfzjn4U8MJoeNhTA9GzOn9rnyE-lP6q8OxGQKja78RQf6759stoQLijh_pjZMLrgYaw3bSyjbkBooQYtczOQxvXexamvxrw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F94A5.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https